   "text": {
    "text": "Best barbers! After trying several other barbers for my son I was recommended Fade barbers. And it was the best recommendation. My son wont let anyone else cut his hair. The guys have an excellent eye for detail and wont rush even if theres a long queue of people. They listen to what you want and are very patient with my son who cant sit still. Highly recommend these guys! You wont regret it",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
