   "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201bFIxcHFNMjFoVVZOaFRsUmFUbnBIU21Oak1FRRAB!2m1!1s0x487761b5df99a20f:0x252e86a47ad5d13c"
  },
  {
   "name": "places/ChIJD6KZ37Vhd0gRPNHVeqSGLiU/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Cc1Z6SnpTR1prWjBreVYyVk5ia0Z5WTBGalRsRRAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "Finding a new barber is never easy. My old barber had been cutting my hair for years and after he moved away, I was honestly worried about trying someone new. I went to a few different places but always left disappointed — either the blend wasn’t right or the service just didn’t feel the same. Then I came across this shop, and I can honestly say I won’t be looking anywhere else again.\n\nMy barber here is Anas, and he never disappoints. From day one he knew exactly how I wanted my haircut and beard done, and he gets it spot on every single time. The fade and blend are always sharp and clean, and he takes the time to make sure every detail is right. It’s rare to find that level of consistency, but with Anas you know you’ll walk out looking fresh every time.\n\nI also really appreciate the waxing service they offer. I’ve got sensitive skin and don’t get on well with razors, so the wax is a lifesaver. It’s done properly and professionally, leaving a smooth finish without irritation. Add the hot towel at the end and the whole experience feels top-class.\n\nThe shop itself has a really friendly and welcoming vibe. The lads are easy to talk to, professional, and make you feel comfortable straight away. I now come back on a weekly basis and it’s become part of my routine. It’s not just about the haircut, it’s the full service and atmosphere that makes it stand out.\n\nIf you’re looking for a barber who listens, takes pride in their work, and delivers every single time, this is the place to go. Big thanks to Anas for always keeping me looking sharp — I genuinely wouldn’t go anywhere else.",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
    "text": "Finding a new barber is never easy. My old barber had been cutting my hair for years and after he moved away, I was honestly worried about trying someone new. I went to a few different places but always left disappointed — either the blend wasn’t right or the service just didn’t feel the same. Then I came across this shop, and I can honestly say I won’t be looking anywhere else again.\n\nMy barber here is Anas, and he never disappoints. From day one he knew exactly how I wanted my haircut and beard done, and he gets it spot on every single time. The fade and blend are always sharp and clean, and he takes the time to make sure every detail is right. It’s rare to find that level of consistency, but with Anas you know you’ll walk out looking fresh every time.\n\nI also really appreciate the waxing service they offer. I’ve got sensitive skin and don’t get on well with razors, so the wax is a lifesaver. It’s done properly and professionally, leaving a smooth finish without irritation. Add the hot towel at the end and the whole experience feels top-class.\n\nThe shop itself has a really friendly and welcoming vibe. The lads are easy to talk to, professional, and make you feel comfortable straight away. I now come back on a weekly basis and it’s become part of my routine. It’s not just about the haircut, it’s the full service and atmosphere that makes it stand out.\n\nIf you’re looking for a barber who listens, takes pride in their work, and delivers every single time, this is the place to go. Big thanks to Anas for always keeping me looking sharp — I genuinely wouldn’t go anywhere else.",
